# Byte-compiled — regenerated on every run, never part of the distribution
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Environments
.venv/
venv/
env/

# Editors / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# Word lock files, left behind when a document is open or Word crashed
~$*

# Verra's UDef-ARP reference releases, kept beside this package for the comparison work.
# Third-party code with its own provenance, and deliberately NOT published from here: the
# README states that it is not shipped with this tool. VERRA_REFERENCE_CODE.md records which
# releases these are and the SHA-256 of every file, so a comparison stays checkable without
# redistributing them.
/verra_code/
